 "layout": "<div class=\"booklet\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:2px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:9pt\">A2 KEY · MOCK FINAL</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:20pt\">Listening</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">Four parts, twenty questions. You will hear every part twice. Answer every question — a wrong answer costs nothing.</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#F2F8F8;border:1px solid #127D80;padding:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">The recording</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:#6E6E6E\">Put your headphones on and press play. Every part is heard twice on the recording, so do not go back to the beginning.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:#6E6E6E\">Listening, track 99.02</span></p></td></tr></table><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#127D80;width:92px;border:0;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:11pt\">PART 1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">Questions 1–5 · five short conversations</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">You will hear five short conversations. For each question, choose A, B or C.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">1</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">What is the weather like now?</span> <span data-mcq=\"1\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">2</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Which sport does the boy play now?</span> <span data-mcq=\"2\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">3</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">How much did the shoes cost?</span> <span data-mcq=\"3\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">4</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">What did they forget?</span> <span data-mcq=\"4\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">5</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Where is the woman going?</span> <span data-mcq=\"5\"></span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#127D80;width:92px;border:0;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:11pt\">PART 2</span></p></td><td style=\"border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">Questions 6–10 · who does what</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">Listen to Laura telling a friend about the people in her music class. What does each person play? For questions 6 to 10, write a letter A to H next to each person.</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#F2F8F8;border:1px solid #127D80;padding:10px 12px\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>A</b> &nbsp;the piano</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>B</b> &nbsp;the guitar</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>C</b> &nbsp;the violin</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>D</b> &nbsp;the drums</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>E</b> &nbsp;the flute</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><spa